title: "Even Synthesis Is Transport: At 3B, Implicit Multi-Hop Reasoning Reduces to Retrieval-and-Elimination, and Composition Appears Only as Externalized Self-Delivery"
type: article
authors:
  - family-names: "Vyaltsev"
    given-names: "Evgenii"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-3712-6798"
  - family-names: "Vyaltsev"
